  "title": "USCB Financial Holdings, Inc. Declares Quarterly Cash Dividend on Common Stock",
  "summary": "MIAMI, April 20, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- USCB Financial Holdings, Inc. (the “Company”) (NASDAQ: USCB), the holding company for U.S. Century Bank, announced today that its Board of Directors declared a regular quarterly cash dividend of $0.125 per share of Class A common stock, payable on June 5,",
